N - number of pairs of secrets
vary between 1 and 10

L - number of bits in each secret
fixed at 2 
could vary this but it has little influence on most properties
and more importantly has is a major factor on the size of the state space

Idea give students one or two of the different scheduling of the
messages and they must construct the remaining (or their own). Also
only give one or two properties and they must construct the remaining -
this involves writing formulae,adding reward structures and in some
cases changing the model.

Look for ways to add nondeterminism as well?

